{"ID":"20260206183337-lnb1wqb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"api/icon/getDynamicIcon?type=6\u0026amp;color=%23d23f31\u0026amp;date=2026-02-06\u0026amp;weekdayType=1\u0026amp;lang=","id":"20260206183337-lnb1wqb","title":"神经网络学习","type":"doc","updated":"20260303130727"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206192820-otltgbs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260206192820-otltgbs","updated":"20260303130727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 基础神经网络架构学习"}]},{"ID":"20260206195039-harzpxh","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"|序号|名称|主要简介|\n| :--------------------------: | ---------------------------| :-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------: |\n|1|\u003cspan data-type=\"block-ref\" data-subtype=\"d\" data-id=\"20260201125229-m656ezj\"\u003eLeNet-5\u003c/span\u003e|LeNet-5 卷积神经网络的鼻祖。由 Yann LeCun 于 1998 年提出，主要用于手写数字识别（MNIST）。它确立了 CNN“的经典结构，虽然网络较浅，但为现代深度学习的发展奠定了基础。|\n|2|\u003cspan data-type=\"block-ref\" data-subtype=\"d\" data-id=\"20260206191940-pxl4245\"\u003eAlexNet\u003c/span\u003e|AlexNet 深度学习爆发的开端。2012 年 ImageNet 竞赛冠军。它首次在大规模图像上使用 ReLU 激活函数、Dropout 防止过拟合及 GPU 加速训练。其错误率的大幅降低证明了深层 CNN 的强大能力，引领了 AI 热潮。|\n|3|\u003cspan data-type=\"block-ref\" data-subtype=\"d\" data-id=\"20260206192147-45jp7aq\"\u003eVGGNet\u003c/span\u003e|VGGNet 小卷积核与深度的代表。由牛津大学 VGG 组提出。其特点是结构简洁规整，全部使用 \u003cspan data-type=\"inline-math\" data-subtype=\"math\" data-content=\"3\\times3\" contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"render-node\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e 小卷积核堆叠。通过加深层数显著提升了性能，其结构常被用作后续任务的特征提取骨干。|\n|{: colspan=\"1\"}4|{: colspan=\"1\"}\u003cspan data-type=\"block-ref\" data-subtype=\"d\" data-id=\"20260206192314-s2ofdp1\"\u003eGoogleNet\u003c/span\u003e|{: colspan=\"1\"}GoogLeNet 多尺度特征融合。2014 年 ImageNet 竞赛冠军。它引入了 Inception 模块，通过并行使用不同尺寸的卷积核提取特征，在增加网络深度的同时有效控制了参数量和计算成本。|\n|{: colspan=\"1\"}5|{: colspan=\"1\"}\u003cspan data-type=\"block-ref\" data-subtype=\"d\" data-id=\"20260206192508-7vlgudd\"\u003eResNet\u003c/span\u003e|{: colspan=\"1\"}ResNet 残差连接解决深层训练难题。2015 年 ImageNet 竞赛冠军。针对深层网络梯度消失问题，提出了残差学习和跳跃连接，使得训练成百上千层的超深神经网络成为可能，是目前应用最广泛的网络之一。|\n|6|\u003cspan data-type=\"block-ref\" data-subtype=\"d\" data-id=\"20260206201501-cw8y94v\"\u003eNetwork In Network\u003c/span\u003e|Network In Network \u003cspan data-type=\"inline-math\" data-subtype=\"math\" data-content=\"1\\times1\" contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"render-node\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e 卷积与全局池化的先驱。核心创新有两点：一是提出了“微网络”结构，首次引入 \u003cspan data-type=\"inline-math\" data-subtype=\"math\" data-content=\"1\\times1\" contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"render-node\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e 卷积 来增强非线性表达能力并降低维度；二是使用 全局平均池化 替代最后的全连接层，大幅减少了参数量并防止过拟合。这两项设计对后来的 GoogLeNet 和 ResNet 产生了深远影响。|\n|{: colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"}7\u003cbr /\u003e|{: colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"}\u003cspan data-type=\"block-ref\" data-subtype=\"d\" data-id=\"20260206202357-gdymd2a\"\u003eDenseNet\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e|{: colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"}DenseNet 极致的特征重用。CVPR 2017 最佳论文。其核心是密集连接，在一个模块内，每一层都直接接收前面所有层的输出作为输入。这种设计最大化了信息流和梯度传播，缓解了梯度消失问题，且相比 ResNet，它能以更少的参数量实现极高的性能，显著提升了特征利用率。\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"a\" data-href=\"assets/AxMath-20260303130727-gi7zqb1.exe\"\u003eAxMath.exe\u003c/span\u003e|\n|{: class=\"fn__none\"}|{: class=\"fn__none\"}|{: class=\"fn__none\"}|","TableAligns":[2,0,2],"Properties":{"colgroup":"min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;|min-width: 60px;","id":"20260206195039-harzpxh","style":"text-align: left;","updated":"20260303130727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"序号"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名称"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要简介"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[2,0,2],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260201125229-m656ezj","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"LeNet-5"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LeNet-5 卷积神经网络的鼻祖。由 Yann LeCun 于 1998 年提出，主要用于手写数字识别（MNIST）。它确立了 CNN“的经典结构，虽然网络较浅，但为现代深度学习的发展奠定了基础。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[2,0,2],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206191940-pxl4245","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AlexNet 深度学习爆发的开端。2012 年 ImageNet 竞赛冠军。它首次在大规模图像上使用 ReLU 激活函数、Dropout 防止过拟合及 GPU 加速训练。其错误率的大幅降低证明了深层 CNN 的强大能力，引领了 AI 热潮。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[2,0,2],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192147-45jp7aq","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"VGGNet 小卷积核与深度的代表。由牛津大学 VGG 组提出。其特点是结构简洁规整，全部使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"3\\times3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 小卷积核堆叠。通过加深层数显著提升了性能，其结构常被用作后续任务的特征提取骨干。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[2,0,2],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Properties":{"colspan":"1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: colspan=\"1\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTe